17:["$","main",null,{"className":"docs_main__7o2m6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"docs_articleMeta__8zYHO","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"LESSON 04 OF 8"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Systems"}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"docs_article__Ja_Vh","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":[[["$","h1","h1-0",{"children":"Timeouts, retries, and dead-letter queues"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Retries can recover from temporary failure, but they also repeat work and add load. Treat each retry as a deliberate decision based on the failure, the job's deadline, and the safety of its effect."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"classify-failures-before-setting-a-policy","children":"Classify failures before setting a policy"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"For an export worker, distinguish:"}],"\n",["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Failure"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"First response"}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":"Why"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["File store returns a transient ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"503"}]]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Retry with bounded backoff and jitter"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"The dependency may recover"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Source document no longer exists"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Mark failed or skip by policy"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Repeating cannot restore the input"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Message schema version is unsupported"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Quarantine and alert"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Every retry would fail the same way"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Worker times out after file creation"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Check durable result before retrying"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"The effect may already exist"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Tenant loses permission"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Stop and record a safe failure"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Authorization must be checked at execution"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["Use ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"timeouts"}]," at every network call so a stuck dependency does not occupy a worker indefinitely. Allow a little margin between the dependency timeout, the worker's overall deadline, and the broker visibility lease. A circuit breaker can temporarily stop calls to a clearly failing dependency, but a queued job still needs a later retry or explicit failure outcome."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"bound-the-retry-budget","children":"Bound the retry budget"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"One policy might attempt after about 0, 2, 6, and 14 seconds, with jitter, then quarantine the job. The numbers are illustrative; derive them from the dependency's recovery behavior and the user's completion promise. Jitter spreads retries from many workers so they do not all strike a recovering service together. Avoid stacking independent SDK, worker, and broker retries without counting their combined attempts."}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["Keep a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"deadline"}]," or maximum elapsed time as well as an attempt limit. A four-attempt policy that stretches beyond the user's useful window is not reliable delivery. Record attempt count, last error class, and next eligible time without leaking document content into logs."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"diagram-bounded-failure-handling","children":"Diagram: bounded failure handling"}],"\n",["$","figure","p-5",{"className":"docs_studyFigure__4Js_y","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"docs_studyFigureViewport__ZYDNN","children":["$","img","img-0",{"className":"docs_studyFigureImage__Gb2YJ","src":"/learning/async-systems/retries.svg","alt":"A claimed job calls a dependency; success persists a result, while repeated failure moves through retry to a dead-letter queue and reviewed replay.","width":"920","height":"402","loading":"lazy"}]}],"$L23"]}],"\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e"],false]}]]}],"$L2f"]}]
